  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Update Cycle for Journalists on Democracy and Elections.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Update Cycle for Journalists on Democracy and Elections.

Professional training process aimed at journalists from the media - press, radio, television and digital media - in Guatemala on issues of democracy and the electoral system to help strengthen independent journalism, coverage of the electoral process and promote a better understanding of the context by citizens for decision-making. The trainings  incorporate the gender perspective so that journalists incorporate this perspective in their daily work.</narrative>
  </description>
